        "uh": "Poort: 19.30.",
        "ctx": "Open Air Film Night in Greenfield Park, Saturday 14 August. Gates open at 19.30 and the film starts when it gets dark, at about 21.15. Tickets cost 9 euros (7 euros for students with a valid card) and can only be bought online until Friday 18.00; if the evening is not sold out, a few tickets will be sold at the gate for 11 euros. Bring a blanket or a folding chair, because seats are not provided. Food trucks will be selling snacks from 19.30, but outside drinks and glass bottles are not allowed. If it rains heavily, the film is moved to Sunday 15 August at the same time. Dogs on a lead are welcome. Visitors in wheelchairs can use the special entrance at the east gate, where volunteers will help."
