      "u": "(a) →AB = B − A = (5−1, 1−3) = (4, −2). →AC = C − A = (4−1, 6−3) = (3, 3).\n(b) →AB · →AC = 4·3 + (−2)·3 = 12 − 6 = 6. |→AB| = √(16 + 4) = √20 = 2√5. |→AC| = √(9 + 9) = √18 = 3√2.\n(c) cos(∠BAC) = (→AB · →AC) / (|→AB| · |→AC|) = 6 / (2√5 · 3√2) = 6 / (6√10) = 1/√10. ∠BAC = arccos(1/√10) ≈ arccos(0,3162) ≈ 71,6°."
